{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309370","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130937001:1":{"text":"빨리 부족에 도움을 청하러 가야 해요.","source_cn":"我们要去其他聚落求援。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD12649E1C83AE705","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130937002:1":{"text":"최근에 폭주한 동물이 저희 부족을 덮치거나, 본 적도 없는 아주 거대한 몬스터까지 나타나는 등 이상한 일이 많이 일어났어요!","source_cn":"最近发生了好多怪事，老是有发狂的动物闯进我们部落，这两...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x646EA12C83553B76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1130937002":{"text":"최근에 폭주한 동물이 저희 부족을 덮치거나, 본 적도 없는 아주 거대한 몬스터까지 나타나는 등 이상한 일이 많이 일어났어요!","source_cn":"最近发生了好多怪事，老是有发狂的动物闯进我们部落，这两天还出现了一种巨大的、黑色的怪物！以前见都没见过！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x646EA12C83553B76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130937003:1":{"text":"뭐라고 설명할지… 전 멀리서 한 번 봤을 뿐이에요.","source_cn":"该怎么说呢……我只远远地见过它一次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43538BF2A43E7926","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130937004:1":{"text":"온몸이 시커멓고 엄청나게 컸어요. 그 몬스터의 한 발짓에 부족에서 가장 큰 집도 우수수 무너져 내렸고요!","source_cn":"它通体漆黑，体型庞大，在它面前，部落里最大的房子也不堪一击！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE4B7889C0B62699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1130937005:1":{"text":"털이 없는 걸 봐서 동물 같지는 않고… 굳이 설명하자면 실체가 없는 안개 같았어요…","source_cn":"不像是野兽，完全没有皮毛，倒很像是有实体的烟雾……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD402C3384D3FAE84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1130937006:1":{"text":"아, 빨리 오라큘라를 일으켜서 떠나야겠어요. 이대로라면 마을이 사라질지도 몰라요!","source_cn":"哎呀，不能再聊了！我得催奥奎拉起来赶路了，不然都不知道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87165371B62E3100","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"어떤 몬스터인데?","source_cn":"是什么样的怪物？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4F8005F8DDDEC52D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어떤 몬스터인데?","female":"어떤 몬스터인데?","variant_male_record_index":"63000","variant_female_record_index":"63001","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血塔比提":{"text":"타비티","source":"蛮血塔比提","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":1}}